sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Block as BlockListener
  participant Mempool as MempoolScanner
  participant DEX as DEX Price Feed
  participant Detect as OpportunityDetector
  participant Sim as REVM Simulator
  participant Build as BundleBuilder
  participant Relay as MEV Relay
  participant Chain as Blockchain
  participant Recon as Recon Service

  Note over Block,Chain: Stage 1: DETECT
  Block->>Mempool: New block header
  Mempool->>DEX: Query pool states
  DEX-->>Mempool: Token prices, reserves
  Mempool->>Detect: Pool state + mempool txs

  Note over Detect,Sim: Stage 2: SELECT
  Detect->>Detect: Run bounded DFS for paths
  Detect->>Sim: Profitable path found?
  Sim->>Sim: Simulate with REVM (state fork)
  Sim-->>Detect: Expected profit + gas

  Note over Detect,Build: Stage 3: SIMULATE
  alt Profitable
    Detect->>Build: Approve execution
    Build->>Build: Construct bundle (backrun)
    Build->>Build: Sign transactions

    Note over Build,Relay: Stage 4: EXECUTE
    Build->>Relay: Submit bundle
    Relay->>Chain: Include in next block
    Chain-->>Relay: Block receipt
    Relay-->>Build: Inclusion status

    Note over Build,Recon: Stage 5: RECONCILE
    Build->>Recon: Execution report
    Recon->>Recon: Calculate actual P&L
    Recon->>DEX: Verify final state
    DEX-->>Recon: Confirmed balances
    Recon->>Recon: Update strategy stats
  else Not Profitable
    Detect->>Detect: Discard, continue scanning
  end
